WEBVTT

00:20:59.433 --> 00:21:03.394
for diverse executives,
C-suite executives,

00:21:03.418 --> 00:21:06.492
in the next, I would say,
three to five years,

00:21:06.516 --> 00:21:09.176
I don't see a lot of placements happening.

00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:12.744
WPR: And are you hopeful in this moment?

00:21:12.768 --> 00:21:16.508
Do you feel like we are
making progress towards this?

00:21:17.547 --> 00:21:19.396
RB: It's early days.

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:21.777
I'm hopeful.

00:21:22.619 --> 00:21:26.294
I feel good about the conversations
that are happening.

00:21:26.318 --> 00:21:32.475
I'm seeing change in people
thinking more about themselves